        "id": "QuinnPassive",
        "name": "Harrier",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Valor, Quinn's Demacian eagle, periodically marks enemies with <keywordMajor>Harrier</keywordMajor>. Quinn's first basic attack against <keywordMajor>Harrier</keywordMajor> targets will deal bonus physical damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Harrier</span><span>Every <span style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">?</span> seconds, Valor marks a nearby enemy as <span style=\"color: #FFF673\">Vulnerable</span>, revealing it for 4 seconds. Quinn's next attack on the target deals ? <span style=\"color: #FF9900\">( + ?)</span> (?% of her Attack Damage) physical damage.<br /><br />Harrier's cooldown is reduced by Critical Strike Chance.</span>",
