        "name": "Blinding Assault",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Quinn calls Valor to mark an enemy and hinder its vision before damaging all enemies in the immediate area.",
        "bodyHtml": "Quinn orders Valor to dive, making the first enemy hit with <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Harrier</span>, reducing their vision radius for 1.75 seconds and dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(65/100/135/170/205 + ([[si:scalead]]80/85/90/95/100% bonus Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]50% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> to all surrounding enemies.<br /><br />If the first enemy struck is not a champion, it is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Disarmed</span> for 1.75 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 100% increased damage to Monsters ((130/200/270/340/410 + (160/170/180/190/200% bonus Attack Damage) + (100% Ability Power))).</span>",
